WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Before releasing a vehicle, confirm that checks are complete and the exit route

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
is safe. Gain the driver's attention first, then turn and extend both arms

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
toward the approved exit. Observe the vehicle until it clears the controlled area.

